SUMMARY:Grief Summer Studio Series: Print-Making
DESCRIPTION:We are honored to partner with Prof. Tyler Starr and Davidson College for this special workshop\, utilizing painting and printmaking techniques. Each participant will create a one-of-a-kind piece of artwork\, based on a photo that you provide. Come prepared to get messy as we engage in this playful opportunity to honor and remember your loved one. Participants will be asked to provide a digital copy of a favorite photo of their loved one in advance. \nChildren and teens are welcome to register with a participating adult. \nRegistration is limited\, please call 919-719-7199 to reserve your space.
URL:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/event/grief-summer-studio-series-print-making/
LOCATION:Transitions LifeCare\, 250 Hospice Circle\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Grief Support,Grief Support for Adults,Grief Support for Kids & Teens,Kids Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Art-supplies-pexels-karola-g-7283165.jpg
GEO:35.8074456;-78.7418081
